# Cloudflare Pages custom headers.
# Forces every HTML page to revalidate with the server on each load instead of
# trusting a locally cached copy — fixes browsers (Brave especially, on
# mobile) holding onto stale HTML that still points at an old JS bundle
# after a new deploy.
#
# Hashed build assets (JS/CSS under /_astro/) are untouched below and keep
# long-term immutable caching, since their filename changes whenever the
# content changes — no staleness risk there, no reason to slow those down.

/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache, must-revalidate

/_astro/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
